      "display_title": "Issue #20: Audit Client-Side Publishing Triggers for Google and Panorra",
      "main_description_html": "<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/125530399/643304713-63427583-2ee3-40f2-96d6-953c72842dca.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTAwMDE3NTcsIm5iZiI6MTc5MDAwMTQ1NywicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjU1MzAzOTkvNjQzMzA0NzEzLTYzNDI3NTgzLTJlZTMtNDBmMi05NmQ2LTk1M2M3Mjg0MmRjYS5wbmc_.d2PAchWZmOv2jAjWTokfGERLL4BPvtFlpnISnODg7pI\"><img width=\"384\" height=\"37\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/125530399/643304713-63427583-2ee3-40f2-96d6-953c72842dca.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3OTAwMDE3NTcsIm5iZiI6MTc5MDAwMTQ1NywicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjU1MzAzOTkvNjQzMzA0NzEzLTYzNDI3NTgzLTJlZTMtNDBmMi05NmQ2LTk1M2M3Mjg0MmRjYS5wbmc_.d2PAchWZmOv2jAjWTokfGERLL4BPvtFlpnISnODg7pI\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 37px;; aspect-ratio: 384 / 37; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Description:</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Investigate front-end action triggers and status callbacks when users initiate publishing tasks to Google Street View and Panorra.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Acceptance Criteria:</h2>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Ensure publishing modal triggers properly handle request dispatches for both target destinations.</li>\n<li>Provide immediate visual error reporting and status state updates if a publishing task fails to initialize.</li>\n</ol>",
